### Create Module
POST http://localhost:5000/modules/add_module
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mod_name": "MERN Stack Development",
  "mod_tech": "MERN",
  "mod_duration": "6 months"
}

### Get All Modules
GET http://localhost:5000/modules/get_all_module

### Get Module by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/modules/get_module_by_id/863662d6-7565-4ba7-aaa5-5ecc9d6cae9e

### Update Module
PUT http://localhost:5000/modules/update_module
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mod_id": "6503caf1-fb75-4640-99f2-d6a529b71205",
  "mod_name": "Full Stack Development",
  "mod_tech": "MERN",
  "mod_duration": "06/04/2025 - 10/04/2025"
}

###  Delete Module
DELETE http://localhost:5000/modules/delete_module/f4e59446-5b4b-4504-8932-f10f07794a90

### Get Module Name by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/modules/get_module_name_by_id/6503caf1-fb75-4640-99f2-d6a529b71205